    "markdown": "---\ntitle: \"Sample Descriptive Statistics\"\nformat: html\n---\n\n\nIn this file, we'll import all of the Dallas County files provided and create preliminary cross-tabulations and merges to explore basic counts, trends, and double check primary keys and joins across the data files. \n\nSee `Codebooks` and `Data Diagram` tabs for more information on each individual data file. \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n# Sample Descriptives\n\n**Data Sample:** Supervision records of DCJD juveniles on either Court-Ordered Probation/Permanent Probation/Deferred Prosecution at any point from 10/1/2017 through 9/30/2022\n\n\n\n## Table 1. Unique Youth and Referrals by Year (Year of Referral)\n\n\n::: {.cell}\n::: {.cell-output-display}\n`````{=html}\n<table class=\"table table-striped table-hover table-condensed table-responsive\" style=\"margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\">\n <thead>\n  <tr>\n   <th style=\"text-align:center;\"> Year of Referral </th>\n   <th style=\"text-align:center;\"> Unique Youth (N) </th>\n   <th style=\"text-align:center;\"> Unique Referrals (N) </th>\n   <th style=\"text-align:center;\"> Referrals, Percent of Sample (%) </th>\n  </tr>\n </thead>\n<tbody>\n  <tr>\n   <td style=\"text-align:center;\"> 2010 </td>\n   <td style=\"text-align:center;\"> 1 </td>\n   <td style=\"text-align:center;\"> 1 </td>\n   <td style=\"text-align:center;\"> 0.0% </td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n   <td style=\"text-align:center;\"> 2011 </td>\n   <td style=\"text-align:center;\"> 9 </td>\n   <td style=\"text-align:center;\"> 12 </td>\n   <td style=\"text-align:center;\"> 0.1% </td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n   <td style=\"text-align:center;\"> 2012 </td>\n   <td style=\"text-align:center;\"> 32 </td>\n   <td style=\"text-align:center;\"> 38 </td>\n   <td style=\"text-align:center;\"> 0.2% </td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n   <td style=\"text-align:center;\"> 2013 </td>\n   <td style=\"text-align:center;\"> 90 </td>\n   <td style=\"text-align:center;\"> 121 </td>\n   <td style=\"te